stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Calculated: 算法生成或复制
    Calculated --> Edited: 人工修改
    Edited --> Validated: 校验通过
    Calculated --> Validated: 校验通过
    Validated --> Scheduled: 绑定调度
    Scheduled --> DispatchPending: 到达执行时间
    DispatchPending --> Dispatched: 设备接受
    Dispatched --> Active: 运行状态确认
    DispatchPending --> Failed: 超时或拒绝
    Dispatched --> Failed: 执行状态不一致
    Failed --> RollbackPending: 选择回滚
    RollbackPending --> Active: 恢复旧方案
    Active --> Superseded: 新版本生效

